        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Apartment – Glenville Garden, Mount Merrion\r\n\r\nSavills New Homes is delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom apartment at Glenville Garden, an exclusive new development in the highly sought-after location of Mount Merrion.\r\n\r\nDesigned with contemporary living in mind, this beautifully finished apartment offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation with an excellent sense of space and natural light throughout.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. The contemporary kitchen is finished to a high standard, while large windows enhance the light-filled interiors and connect the living space with the private outdoor area.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation also includes three generously sized bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish main bathroom and excellent storage throughout.\r\n\r\nGlenville Garden occupies an outstanding position on Foster Avenue, directly opposite UCD and within easy reach of Mount Merrion, Blackrock and Stillorgan. Residents can enjoy an excellent range of nearby shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities, with the 32-acre Deerpark also close by.\r\n\r\nThe development is exceptionally well connected, with numerous bus routes and the N11 providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, a high-quality specification and an exceptional South Dublin location, this three-bedroom apartment offers an excellent opportunity to secure a new home in one of Dublin’s most established residential areas."
      }
